o have encountered  aliens have said that  the aliens spoke to them in their native  language  could future humans simply have  automatic language translators  implanted in their brains or would  humans of the future  evolve past different languages  instead using one universal language  like esperanto if you think this topic  has  more to it than just a what if then why  don't you join us on the what if disgust  podcast  we go further in depth with the  possibilities of aliens  actually being humans from the future  with dr mike masters of montana tech  university  who has written a book postulating that  aliens are actually future humans  traveling back in time to better  understand their past  by better understanding us

